        "slc_c3cfee2e1b1b097a340815ff620afcd395122a7cd3c17dde65f5512083612d3f"
      ],
      "text": "The repo ships apps including an orchestrator entrypoint, a world editor (formerly Trident), an animation editor, a docs website, and a vanilla Three.js playground."
